{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56845","headline":"徐登诗句 · 不详","name":"徐登诗句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"凤立烟霄迥，桃香碧涧逢。\n（见《全闽诗话》卷十一）（〖1〗《全闽诗话》云，徐登，「神仙，兄弟姊妹七人，隐於闽国西岳名山。\n乾封时来於絶顶，仪封二年化於潭上。\n」仪封，当爲「仪凤」之误。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56845.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56845","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}